-to-code workflow, asset metadata and UI/test implementation; docs/prd.md and docs/tdd.md are published. Source-checked; full reproduction not performed.",[711],{"_57":553,"_27":712,"_233":713},"https://github.com/chongdashu/phaserjs-tinyswords","Full public/index.html game, Tiny Swords assets, PRD, technical design and UI test harness are included. Open public/index.html in a modern browser. No root LICENSE was found; artwork retains Pixel Frog terms. Do not assume unrestricted reuse.",[715],{"_57":716,"_27":717,"_233":718},"Play Castle Clash Duel","https://vibe-tiny-swords.vercel.app/","Author-linked browser prototype with mouse or touch controls. The local public/index.html loads Phaser 3.70.0 from a CDN.",[720],{"_57":721,"_27":701,"_233":-7},"查看从 PRD 到游戏的开发流程",[723,724,725,726],"Play a two-player battle and identify recruitment, movement, attacks and castle victory conditions.","Read the published PRD and technical design before tracing the game’s single-file scene logic.","Inspect the Tiny Swords asset metadata and the custom panels used to handle sprite padding.","Change one unit or UI rule with an agent, then replay the battle and inspect the included test harness.","作者先准备需求文档、技术设计与素材元数据，再使用三个 Claude Code 技能实现 Phaser 玩法、地图和前端测试。美术是另行署名的人工作品；当前项目仍是原型。",[723,724,725,726],{"_57":735,"_27":701,"_19":286},{"_57":716,"_27":717,"_19":244,"_233":718},{"_57":579,"_27":712,"_233":713,"_284":285},{"_57":734,"_27":701,"_233":709},[283,125],"Read the creator’s AI attribution","Read the PRD-to-game workflow","resource:phaser","resource","浏览器 2D 游戏框架，官方入门教程覆盖资产、场景、动画、输入和碰撞。","/zh/resources/",{"_21":125,"_805":103,"_273":806,"_55":807,"_804":738,"_799":798,"_27":796,"_67":808,"_782":809,"_773":810,"_770":811,"_766":204},[743,744,745,746,747,748,749,750,751,752,753,754,755],"website/src/data/resources.json",{"_55":23,"_59":103,"_61":805,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":119,"_59":738,"_61":804,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":802,"_59":803,"_61":273,"_63":98,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_